{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Curse of Dominion</i> is a story-driven tactical RPG that fuses classic grid-based strategy with modern gameplay systems and deep, choice-driven progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command armies, forge alliances, and carve your legacy across a continent where survival demands conquest.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50\u201360 hours for the main story, with optional territory conquests, character stories, and tactical challenges extending playtime even further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, grid-based battles where positioning, terrain, and formation matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral choices in battle and dialogue shape your army\u2019s strength and character bonds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat growth is influenced by class choices, rewarding strategic planning and battlefield performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build support relationships between allies to unlock story events and tactical bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character blessings that unlock through achievement and personal growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A serious, character-driven story about ambition, survival, and the cost of power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen graphics \u2014 supporting DLSS super resolution scaling and frame generation to deliver a smooth, modern experience on a wide range of PCs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/696bf1ede454b6fd696d03d219a50929.avif?t=1756489530\" width=700 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Curse of Dominion, power flows through ancient forces known as Blessings\u2014mysterious abilities that can be awakened within rare individuals, though scholars still debate how or why this occurs. These coveted powers can be stolen through bloodshed, making every bearer both hunter and hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two fundamental forces govern most of these Blessings: Order, representing unity and structure, and Chaos, embodying destruction and upheaval. Each is symbolized by the sacred tree\u2014Order channeled through its reaching branches, Chaos through its deep, gnarling roots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent of Elvorith was once a unified realm, ruled from the great castle of Erindos. Ancient tradition spoke of a prophesied awakening\u2014a legendary Blessing that would transcend the division between Order and Chaos and restore true balance to the world. The old king's armor still bears the symbol of the complete tree, a reminder of what was meant to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as generations passed without this prophesied awakening, faith fractured. The people began to revere the individual Blessings instead, and dissenters rose to claim their own domains. To the northwest, the Kingdom of Solvane embraces Chaos and its destructive power. To the southeast, the Selarion Empire champions Order and rigid control. Both are ruled by bearers of their respective Blessings, and both hunger for greater power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, as your story begins, only the castle of Erindos remains of the original unified kingdom\u2014until you awaken the Blessing of Dominion itself. But in a world torn by ancient grudges, such ultimate power may prove more curse than gift. Every kingdom will stop at nothing to claim this legendary force, and you must decide whether dominion over all is worth the price it demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575920?t=1756489530","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575920?t=1756489530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/3a1a602c07a9ddaa5fe64abee8144e522bdf6985/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756489530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/3a1a602c07a9ddaa5fe64abee8144e522bdf6985/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756489530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3815520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Curse of Dominion</i> is a story-driven tactical RPG that fuses classic grid-based strategy with modern gameplay systems and deep, choice-driven progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command armies, forge alliances, and carve your legacy across a continent where survival demands conquest.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50\u201360 hours for the main story, with optional territory conquests, character stories, and tactical challenges extending playtime even further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, grid-based battles where positioning, terrain, and formation matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral choices in battle and dialogue shape your army\u2019s strength and character bonds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat growth is influenced by class choices, rewarding strategic planning and battlefield performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build support relationships between allies to unlock story events and tactical bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character blessings that unlock through achievement and personal growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A serious, character-driven story about ambition, survival, and the cost of power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen graphics \u2014 supporting DLSS super resolution scaling and frame generation to deliver a smooth, modern experience on a wide range of PCs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/extras/696bf1ede454b6fd696d03d219a50929.avif?t=1756489530\" width=700 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Curse of Dominion, power flows through ancient forces known as Blessings\u2014mysterious abilities that can be awakened within rare individuals, though scholars still debate how or why this occurs. These coveted powers can be stolen through bloodshed, making every bearer both hunter and hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two fundamental forces govern most of these Blessings: Order, representing unity and structure, and Chaos, embodying destruction and upheaval. Each is symbolized by the sacred tree\u2014Order channeled through its reaching branches, Chaos through its deep, gnarling roots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent of Elvorith was once a unified realm, ruled from the great castle of Erindos. Ancient tradition spoke of a prophesied awakening\u2014a legendary Blessing that would transcend the division between Order and Chaos and restore true balance to the world. The old king's armor still bears the symbol of the complete tree, a reminder of what was meant to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as generations passed without this prophesied awakening, faith fractured. The people began to revere the individual Blessings instead, and dissenters rose to claim their own domains. To the northwest, the Kingdom of Solvane embraces Chaos and its destructive power. To the southeast, the Selarion Empire champions Order and rigid control. Both are ruled by bearers of their respective Blessings, and both hunger for greater power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, as your story begins, only the castle of Erindos remains of the original unified kingdom\u2014until you awaken the Blessing of Dominion itself. But in a world torn by ancient grudges, such ultimate power may prove more curse than gift. Every kingdom will stop at nothing to claim this legendary force, and you must decide whether dominion over all is worth the price it demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TAR Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575920/042412c1c19ed205bd680a549a42e4294f3190cf/header.jpg?t=1756489530","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Brock Rawson. Developed by TAR Games.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257149148,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149148/movie480.mp4?t=1748741754","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149148/movie_max.mp4?t=1748741754"},"name":"Teaser 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store